# Build context hygiene: keep the context small and never ship secrets or local state.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/dist
**/dist-web
**/.expo
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.pglite
**/.DS_Store
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
apps/api/data
apps/api/test
apps/web/test
apps/web/e2e
apps/web/playwright-report
apps/web/test-results
# Mobile is out of scope for the images; only its manifest is needed so the pnpm workspace resolves.
apps/mobile/*
!apps/mobile/package.json
packages/*/test
.sales-agent-eval
changed-*.json
docs/design
docs/finance
docs/business
Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
